Dear all,

this is a reminder about the Bioconductor Training Committee call on Monday, January 12, 3-4pm CET.
Jitsi link: https://meet.jit.si/BioconductorTeaching

In addition, the application deadline for the committee co-chair position is also coming up next week (January 15) - see email below for more information.

See you on Monday,
Charlotte & Laurent

