Dear Bioconductor Training Committee members,

following the nomination period for the next co-chair of the committee, it is now time to vote for your preferred candidate.
We are delighted to announce that we received two great nominations, from Jenny Drnevich and Wes Wilson.

Please cast your vote via the following Google Form, before February 20: https://forms.gle/81Pdyd3NasMjHCN19
For clarification, also the candidates are entitled to vote.
If you would like to vote but do not have a Google account or for other reasons are not able to access the Google Form, please let us know.

Thank you for your participation and all the best,
Charlotte, Laurent and Maria

